"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2975,"Narrated to us Sallam ibn Junadah, narrated to us Waki' on the authority of Malik ibn Anas, on the authority of 'Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr, on the authority of Abu Badah, on the authority of his father, that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) granted a concession to the shepherds to perform the throwing of the Jamarat at night and to gather the throwing.

**CHAPTER:**"
